# uploads/

# Optional: generated static files
# staticfiles/
Recommended project structure
text
fastapi-project/
├── .gitignore
├── .env.example
├── requirements.txt
├── app/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── main.py
├── tests/
└── venv/